#: ../../source/demos/index.rst:2 36ee9b9dfa0f49399b421759ca6efaaa
msgid "_`Demos`"
msgstr "_`功能演示`"

#: ../../source/demos/index.rst:4 b58926344cc24413a90ceaf722c05cd6
msgid ""
"Every figure below is produced by running this library — no mock-up, no "
"hand-drawn curve. The pipeline is:"
msgstr ""
"下面每一张图都是 **运行本库** 得到的——没有手绘、没有示意图。流程是："

#: ../../source/demos/index.rst:7 dc42c87a08cd4f8caffb9fa26f0120a1
msgid ""
":code:`docs/demos/sil_export.cpp` drives the SIL bench through one "
"scenario and writes a trace and a metrics CSV;"
msgstr ":code:`docs/demos/sil_export.cpp` 驱动 SIL 台架跑一个场景，写出轨迹与指标 CSV；"

#: ../../source/demos/index.rst:9 7e907d920dec4c6587971bc055edd2f7
msgid ""
":code:`docs/demos/make_figures.py` compiles it against the repository "
"sources, runs it, and plots the result;"
msgstr ":code:`docs/demos/make_figures.py` 把它对着仓库源码编译、运行，并把结果画成图；"

#: ../../source/demos/index.rst:11 bfcacc642eb741a4a7b81d1d92f10bef
msgid ":code:`python docs/build.py` copies the figures into the site."
msgstr ":code:`python docs/build.py` 把图复制进站点。"

#: ../../source/demos/index.rst:18 bcc44619761f4064b566a26560f3b4b6
msgid ""
"The scenarios mirror the SIL acceptance suite, so what you see here is "
"the same closed loop the test suite asserts on."
msgstr ""
"这些场景与 SIL 验收用例一一对应，所以你看到的就是测试断言的那条闭环。"

#: ../../source/demos/index.rst:28 a8fa20544d524af5beb5da46c26d084b
msgid ""
"These traces come from the **C++** path with the SIL plant. The C API — "
"and therefore the Python module — runs on the stub HAL, whose current "
"feedback is a fixed script, so it cannot produce a closed loop on its "
"own."
msgstr ""
"这些曲线来自 **C++** 路径 + SIL plant。C API——以及因此的 Python 模块——跑在桩 HAL "
"上，电流反馈是固定脚本，自己构不成闭环。"

